OL,3,GNEWSAPlane and ferry disruption caused
OL,4,Aby high winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British Airways flight which landed
OL,7,Fin Guernsey was forced to return to
OL,8,FLondon Heathrow Airport with all the
OL,9,Fpassengers still on board as high winds
OL,10,Fcaused travel chaos over the weekend.
OL,12,FTravel disruption continued on Saturday
OL,13,Fafter Storm Austen hit the Channel
OL,14,FIslands on Friday, with flights
OL,15,Fcancelled and a ferry held at sea for a
OL,16,Fnumber of hours.
OL,18,FGuernsey Ports said passengers could
OL,19,Fnot be disembarked from the British
OL,20,FAirways Airbus A319 safely because wind
OL,21,Fspeeds were "above the safety limits
OL,22,Ffor all ground handling equipment".
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
